    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d366">

                <pb facs="0615" n="601" sameAs="frus:frus1950v06/pg601"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">320/12–150: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in China </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-12-14T18:00:00-05:00">December 14,
                            1950—6 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>525. Urtel 723, Dec 1. Dept’s present view is that UN consideration status of
                    Formosa shld be postponed perhaps until next session GA and USDel has been
                    instructed accordingly (see Dept info agam Dec 8).<anchor n="1" xml:id="d366-f1"
                    /> While foregoing is present view this Govt you shld bear in mind that
                    settlement nr outstanding problems in Far East has become major concern of other
                    members UN whose views may influence to some degree at least timing and methods
                    of settlement.</p>
                <p>You may in your discretion convey substance foregoing orally and confidentially
                    to FonMins.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d366-f1" n="1" xml:id="d366-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed, but see telegram Gadel 162, December 5, to New York, <ref
                        target="#pg589">p. 589</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
